WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.723
CTEs and windows are most useful when combined into
a pipeline The

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:11.319
first CTE aggregates revenue to department-product
grain The

00:00:11.346 --> 00:00:17.214
second stage ranks those product totals inside each
department The final

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:22.818
query filters to the top ranks Each stage has a
different job and

00:00:22.845 --> 00:00:23.897
a clear row meaning
